            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "worked around the issue by adding `vim.opt.timeout = false` following this <https://github.com/folke/which-key.nvim/issues/837>, i also tried to increase `vim.opt.timeoutlen` to 3000 instead of disabling the timeout completely but that didn't help.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">worked around the issue by adding <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.opt.timeout = false</code> following this <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2499055112\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/folke/which-key.nvim/issues/837\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/folke/which-key.nvim/issues/837/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/folke/which-key.nvim/issues/837\">folke/which-key.nvim#837</a>, i also tried to increase <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.opt.timeoutlen</code> to 3000 instead of disabling the timeout completely but that didn't help.</p>",
            "bodyText": "worked around the issue by adding vim.opt.timeout = false following this folke/which-key.nvim#837, i also tried to increase vim.opt.timeoutlen to 3000 instead of disabling the timeout completely but that didn't help.",
